*1 [[Flame Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Flame Dragon Rider]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Flame Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Flame Dragon Rider]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
